5" anchor="t" anchorCtr="0"><a:noAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr lvl="0"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1400" i="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Indicative plan (Review 0 → final submission). Durations are in project weeks.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="0"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="250"/></a:spcAft></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">Phase 1 – Requirement Analysis &amp; Literature Survey (Weeks 1–3): </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>finalize scope and study existing cross-view and UAV-delivery work.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="0"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="250"/></a:spcAft></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">Phase 2 – Dataset Collection &amp; Annotation (Weeks 4–7): </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>build the India-specific cross-view dataset (rooftops, landmarks, compound walls).</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="0"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="250"/></a:spcAft></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">Phase 3 – Model Development (Weeks 8–12): </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>train the trimodal fusion pipeline (ground photo + text + GPS).</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="0"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="250"/></a:spcAft></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">Phase 4 – Edge-Offload &amp; Drone Integration (Weeks 13–16): </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>run cross-view matching on ESP32-class hardware with server offloading.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="0"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="250"/></a:spcAft></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">Phase 5 – System Integration (Weeks 17–19): </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>connect cloud fleet management, mobile app, and delivery-validation module.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="0"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="250"/></a:spcAft></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">Phase 6 – Testing &amp; Field Trials (Weeks 20–22): </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>validate accuracy, obstacle avoidance, and GPS-denied delivery.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="0"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="250"/></a:spcAft></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">Phase 7 – Evaluation &amp; Documentation (Weeks 23–24): </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>analyze results and prepare the report and final review.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="1926442866"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>